# Generator messages that no test prints (test/lib/messages; checked by
# tools/messages). One line per message: FILE<TAB>FORMAT<TAB>REASON, with
# FORMAT as written between the quotes in FILE. Adding the test that
# prints a message means deleting its line here; tools/messages fails on
# an entry whose message a test prints or that FILE does not have.
src/codegen/codegen.zig	tag '{s}' is produced by an action but not declared in @schema or @tags	untested: needs an adverse test
src/codegen/codegen.zig	side-band roles need @schema	untested: needs an adverse test
src/codegen/codegen.zig	side-band role '{s}' is not declared in @schema	untested: needs an adverse test
src/codegen/codegen.zig	@trivia names '{s}', which is not a lexer token	untested: needs an adverse test
src/codegen/codegen.zig	@as promotes '{s}' and '{s}'; one grammar promotes one token	untested: needs an adverse test
src/codegen/codegen.zig	the grammar has @repair but no repair table was computed	internal invariant: lr.run computes the repair table whenever the grammar has @repair
src/codegen/codegen.zig	{s} is no lexer token, and no @as group matches it (without @lang, group `x` promotes only the word `x`)	untested: needs an adverse test
src/expand.zig	the grammar has more than {d} symbols	untested: a size limit; needs a generated adverse grammar
src/main.zig	failed to parse {s}: {any}	internal: a frontend failure other than a syntax error (out of memory)
src/main.zig	out of memory	internal: out of memory
src/main.zig	cannot read {s}: larger than {d} bytes	untested: a size limit; needs a generated adverse grammar
src/expand.zig	groups and choices nested too deeply (the limit is {d})	internal: the frontend scanner rejects deeper ( ) and [ ] first (lang.zig maxNesting); kept as a backstop
src/expand.zig	action nodes nested too deeply (the limit is {d})	internal: the frontend scanner rejects deeper ( ) first (lang.zig maxNesting); kept as a backstop
src/main.zig	lexer generation failed: {s}	internal: an error other than a reported one (out of memory)
